                    <h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
                    <p>Cookies are small text files placed on your computer, smartphone, or other device when you visit a website. They help websites function, remember preferences, and understand how visitors use the site.</p>

                    <h2>2. Types of Cookies We Use</h2>
