                    <h3>b. Performance & Analytics Cookies</h3>
                    <p>These cookies collect information about how visitors use our website, such as:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Pages visited</li>
                        <li>Time spent on each page</li>
                        <li>Errors encountered</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>We use this data to improve website performance and user experience.</p>

                    <h3>c. Functional Cookies</h3>
                    <p>These cookies remember your preferences and choices, such as:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Language settings</li>
                        <li>Login details</li>
                        <li>Customized layouts</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>This allows us to provide a more personalized experience.</p>

